sín.: ἐκκλησία (véase) (AS)

he.fuller:
συν-αγωγή, -ῆς, ἡ
[בשבעים בעיקר for עֵדָה, also for קָהָל, ועוד ;]
בעיקרו, a bringing together;
1. of things,
(a) a gathering in of harvest;
(b) a collection of money.
2. Of persons,
(a) a collecting, assembling (Polyb.);
(b) an assembly (MM, xxiv; Deiss., LAE, 101 ff.): התג.2:9 3:9; במיוחד of a Jewish religious assembly, a synagogue: לוקס.12:11, מע״ש.9:2, ועוד; of a Christian assembly, יעק.2:2. By meton., of the building in which the assembly is held, a synagogue: מתי.10:17, מרקוס.1:21, ועוד (השוו Cremer, ר׳ ערך ἐκκλησία)
נרדף: ἐκκλησία (ר׳ ערך) (AS)
